@startuml SQ-01
title SQ-01 Registration & Login [P] — registration method TBD (OQ-AC-01)
actor Player
participant "Game Client" as C
participant "Backend API" as B
database MySQL as DB
== Registration (example: e-mail + password, pending OQ-AC-01) ==
Player -> C : enter credentials
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/register\n{username, email?, password}\nheader X-Client-Version, X-Platform
B -> B : validate input, rate-limit per IP (SEC-008)
B -> B : hash password Argon2id (SEC-004)
B -> DB : INSERT user_account, player_profile,\ncompetitive_record, starter inventory_item [A-04]
DB --> B : ok
B --> C : 201 {userId}
== Login ==
Player -> C : log in
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/login {login, password}\nX-Client-Version
alt client version < minimum (FR-006)
  B --> C : 426 CLIENT_UPDATE_REQUIRED {storeUrl}
else credentials valid
  B -> DB : SELECT user_account; INSERT auth_session (refresh token hash)
  B --> C : 200 {accessToken (15 min), refreshToken, user}
else invalid
  B --> C : 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (generic message)
end
== Token refresh (rotation) ==
C -> B : POST /v1/auth/refresh {refreshToken}
B -> DB : verify hash, revoke old, store new
B --> C : 200 {accessToken, refreshToken}
@enduml
